<title>USA: Blue Chip Value offer priced at $8.31/shr.</title>
<headline>Blue Chip Value offer priced at $8.31/shr.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Chip Value Fund Inc on Monday said it set a price of $8.31 per share on its recently completed rights offering to existing shareholders.</p>
<p>&quot;This is 95 percent of the closing price of the fund's common stock of $8.75 on Friday, March 7,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The fund said it planned to issue 2,843,750 new shares, the maximum allowable under the conditions of the offering. Under the plan, it is issuing one right to purchase an additional share of the fund for each five shares held.</p>
</text>
